Source of the data
-------------------

The data in this package - show dates, venues, attendance, and setlists -
was originally sourced from the Fugazi Live Series website
(https://www.dischord.com/fugazi_live_series), which is copyright Dischord
Records.

Tidying, venue geocoding, and assembly of the raw data
into the tables included here are original work by the package maintainer,
Alex Mitrani.

License terms
--------------

Permission to redistribute Dischord Records' underlying show data openly
has been requested and is pending a reply. For the moment, this package is provided
for personal, non-commercial, and research use only; it is not licensed for
redistribution.

Questions about reuse of the package should be directed to the package maintainer
(see DESCRIPTION) and, for the Fugazi Live Series data, to Dischord Records.
